    <string name="dash_project_intro">Overview</string>
    <string name="dash_intro_body">LSPFRIFA is a dynamic analysis assistant built on Frida GumJS and libxposed. Write JavaScript scripts to run dynamic analysis, collect logs, and automate tasks inside target apps.</string>

    <string name="dash_docs_title">Plugin docs</string>
    <string name="dash_docs_summary">Read about scripts, injection, and logs</string>
    <string name="dash_docs_steps">How to use:\n\n1. On the Projects tab, pick a target app and open its details.\n2. Write a JavaScript script (Frida GumJS / QuickJS).\n3. Tap Run script to push and hot reload it; scripts are saved automatically and load when the target app cold starts.\n4. Open the Analysis tab to watch live logs (console.log / send).\n5. The switch on the right of each project quickly enables or disables hooking for that app.\n\nNote: only selected target apps are injected (critical system processes are excluded).</string>
